    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33899" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">parmŭlārĭus</span></b> ,
			ii, m.
		1. parma, II. B.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>An adherent of the party of the</i> Threces, <i>who were armed with the</i> parma, <i>a Parmularian</i>, <i><span class="en">Suet.
				Dom. 10</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Quint. 2, 11,
			2</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A servant of the</i> pontifices <i>armed with the</i> parma, <i><span class="en">Inscr. Grut.
				1087, 6</span></i>.</div>
